 dream it was kind of a  strange dream it went like I think I  could download the entire web on to some  old computers that were lying around and  that would probably seem pretty crazy to  most people but I stayed up a couple  hours in the middle of the night doing  some math and it seemed actually pretty  plausible while assuming he actually  didn't keep any of the webpages you only  kept the links and then sort of figured  outs  given all that data I thought I would  take a couple weeks and I told my  advisor that and he just sort of laughed  to me and of course took a year or two  but at the end of that we had a way to  rank web pages and no thoughts to search  at all and eventually search entered the  picture and you know the rest  and that became Google  so make your own gentleman follow their  dreams thank you guys so much for  watching I made this video because sick  Nick 95 asked me to so there's a famous  entrepreneur do you want me to profile  next leave it in the comments below and  I'll see what I can do  I'd also love to know what you've Larry  page's top 10 rules meant the most to  you is going to have the biggest impact  on you leave it in the comments below  and I'm going to join in the discussion  thank you guys for watching continue to  believe and I'll see you soon

